# Blade of Evil (bastok 59, DRK AF3): the Beadeaux zone-in, Middle Delkfutt's Tower's qm1, Gerwitz's Scythe and its two
# victims (BLADE_OF_EVIL_OFFSET +0 / +1 / +2), trigger area 8 (the sixth floor's J-6 porter). The guard (Dark Puppet
# completed, DRK, AF3_QUEST_LEVEL 50), the Beadeaux zone-in 122 from Pashhow Marshlands only (begins it), the Vial of
# Quadav Mage Blood at qm1 with Prog 0 and none of the three up (the vial taken, the Scythe popped and claimed, the
# victims on the char's enmity, SENSE_A_FOUL_PRESENCE), the Scythe's death (Prog 1 from Prog 0 only), area 8 at Prog 1
# (14; option 0 completes it: Chaos Burgeonet, fame +20, Paragon of Dark Knight Excellence; another option leaves Prog 1).
# Area 8's fallback is the zone's own porter cutscene (startOptionalCutscene(7)); its finish moves nobody for csid 7 (the
# zone's onEventFinish moves the char only for 0, 1, 2 and 10). In the Lua lookup a trigger area runs the quest's action
# and then the fallback: the porter's 7 is queued behind 14 and opens when 14 finishes, so each 14 is followed by a
# finish-if-event for the 7 (left open, the next entry's start of 7 or 14 logs "already in it"). The qm1's default is
# NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY. xi.player.onGameIn's ZoningIn lock keeps trigger areas off for 2.5 s after a zone-in (hence the
# ticks). The spot 86.5,-81.5,86 is inside area 8's cuboid (x 84..89, y -82..-81, z 83..89): the walks enter it.
# A rezone in Beadeaux keeps prevZone (the engine sets it only on a change of zone), so it is no other arm than Pashhow;
# the qm1 trade's spawned-mob arms are in #nms (the bodies take up to 92 s to despawn).
lists Beadeaux/onZoneIn/1 Beadeaux/onEventFinish/122 MiddleDelkfuttsTower/qm1/onTrade MiddleDelkfuttsTower/qm1/onTrigger MiddleDelkfuttsTower/Gerwitzs_Scythe/onMobDeath MiddleDelkfuttsTower/onTriggerAreaEnter/8 MiddleDelkfuttsTower/onEventFinish/14
char zone=PashhowMarshlands pos=580,21,-377 job=DRK lvl=75
item VialOfQuadavMageBlood
item VialOfQuadavMageBlood
item BoneChip
login
zoneline Beadeaux                    # from Pashhow, Dark Puppet not completed: the zone-in is nil
quest Bastok.DarkPuppet completed
zoneline QulunDome
zoneline Beadeaux                    # all met but from Qulun Dome: nil (not 122)
warp 86.9,-79.6,79 MiddleDelkfuttsTower
trigger qm1                          # available: no handler, NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
finish-if-event
trade qm1 VialOfQuadavMageBlood x1   # available (all met): no trade handler in section 1, nothing (the vial kept)
warp 580,21,-377 PashhowMarshlands
zoneline Beadeaux                    # from Pashhow, all met: 122, answered with option 0: accepted
zoneline PashhowMarshlands
zoneline Beadeaux                    # from Pashhow, accepted: check 1 false (status), no 122
warp 86.9,-79.6,79 MiddleDelkfuttsTower
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
walk 86.5,-81.5,86                   # area 8 at Prog 0: the quest's handler is nil; the porter's 7
finish-if-event
walk 86.9,-79.6,79
trigger qm1                          # no onTrigger in the quest: NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
finish-if-event
trade qm1 BoneChip x1                # the wrong item: nil
trade qm1 VialOfQuadavMageBlood x1   # Prog 0, none up: the vial taken, the three popped, SENSE_A_FOUL_PRESENCE
kill BLADE_OF_EVIL_OFFSET            # the Scythe at Prog 0: Prog 1
kill BLADE_OF_EVIL_OFFSET+1          # a victim: no handler
kill BLADE_OF_EVIL_OFFSET+2          # a victim: no handler
walk 86.5,-81.5,86                   # area 8 at Prog 1: 14
finish option=1                      # declined: Prog 1 kept
finish-if-event                      # the porter's 7, queued behind 14 (the lookup runs the zone's fallback after the quest's action); option 0 moves nobody
walk 86.9,-79.6,79
walk 86.5,-81.5,86                   # area 8 again: 14
finish                               # option 0: completed, Chaos Burgeonet, fame +20, Paragon of Dark Knight Excellence
finish-if-event                      # the porter's 7, queued behind 14
walk 86.9,-79.6,79
walk 86.5,-81.5,86                   # completed: no section matches; the porter's 7
finish-if-event
warp 580,21,-377 PashhowMarshlands
zoneline Beadeaux                    # from Pashhow, completed: check 1 false (status), no 122
